WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.592 --> 00:00:11.053
It has been one hundred
and twenty-one days

00:00:11.053 --> 00:00:14.097
since the aliens
invaded our world.

00:00:14.097 --> 00:00:16.975
♪♪

00:00:20.562 --> 00:00:22.272
We have suffered.

00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:25.692
We have sacrificed

00:00:26.443 --> 00:00:28.612
lives,

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:30.614
loved ones.

00:00:36.787 --> 00:00:38.789
Connection, it's the
only chance we'll have

00:00:38.789 --> 00:00:40.207
to learn what they want.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:44.211
And how to stop them.

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:47.506
My fellow global citizens,

00:00:48.632 --> 00:00:50.008
look up.

00:00:51.593 --> 00:00:53.512
This is our enemy.

00:00:53.512 --> 00:00:55.847
Together we will win this war.

00:01:00.227 --> 00:01:01.687
The aliens,

00:01:01.687 --> 00:01:02.813
somehow connected us.

00:01:03.855 --> 00:01:07.484
This is our last
chance for survival.

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:09.861
Anyway, it sounds mental.

00:01:09.861 --> 00:01:10.821
Yeah, it does sound mental,

00:01:10.821 --> 00:01:12.447
but the whole world's
mental, right?

00:01:12.447 --> 00:01:15.325
♪♪

00:01:15.993 --> 00:01:18.245
The world out there
is falling apart.

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:21.331
I would do anything to hold
this family together.

00:01:21.999 --> 00:01:24.084
They adapted. We'll adapt.

00:01:25.252 --> 00:01:27.004
What if we could save everybody?

00:01:27.713 --> 00:01:28.422
Come back!

00:01:30.549 --> 00:01:32.467
If you wanna win the war,

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:33.844
you fight back.

00:01:35.012 --> 00:01:35.846
Ahhh!

00:01:36.388 --> 00:01:37.848
♪♪

00:01:38.682 --> 00:01:40.058
The answers

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:42.978
are here.

00:01:45.689 --> 00:01:47.858
Are you sure you
want to do this?

00:01:52.988 --> 00:01:59.369
♪♪

